# DIGITAL INDIA PROJECT — COMPLETE WEBSITE & WEB APPLICATION DEVELOPMENT

## ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as an expert full-stack software architect, senior UI/UX designer, SaaS product developer, database engineer, security engineer and DevOps specialist.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, modern, production-ready digital services platform for:

**Business Name:** Digital India Project  
**Domain:** https://digitalindiaproject.com  
**Business Type:** Private Digital Services & Online Registration Assistance Company  
**Primary Market:** India  
**Languages:** English and Hindi  
**Primary Goal:** Enable customers to discover digital services, apply online, upload documents, make payments, receive professional assistance and track their applications.

Build an actual functional web application, not merely a landing page or static UI prototype.

The platform should combine:
- A modern digital services marketplace.
- An online application system.
- A customer account portal.
- An application tracking system.
- A secure document management system.
- An online payment system.
- An administrative management system.
- An AI-powered customer assistance system.

The overall experience should resemble a premium fintech/SaaS platform adapted for Indian digital services.

