# 10. APPLICATION TRACKING ENGINE

Implement a proper application status management engine.

Possible statuses:

- Draft.
- Submitted.
- Awaiting Payment.
- Payment Confirmed.
- Under Review.
- Document Verification.
- Documents Required.
- Application Processing.
- Submitted to External Authority.
- Awaiting External Approval.
- Completed.
- Rejected.
- Cancelled.
- Refund Initiated.
- Refunded.

Admin must be able to configure permitted status transitions.

Every status change must record:
- Previous status.
- New status.
- Updated by.
- Date and time.
- Customer-visible message.
- Internal note.

Never show internal admin notes to customers.

Do not falsely claim that an application has been submitted to a government authority unless that action actually occurred.

